* `Lesson Learned` Used use effect to rerender when prop specific part of prop changed. medicenest is the prop being passed in.
    ```
    useEffect(() => {
        if(Array.isArray(medicinest.medicines)) {
            setMedicine(medicinest.medicines);
        }
    }, [medicinest.medicines]);
    ```

* breifly ran into issue where condition wasnt hiting because was checking Array.isArray(medicinest) wich was always false since medicinest is the complete object and not the array. suggests variable refactoring is needed.

